#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:7 69d61a54a47645dfb531b0db16fd6506
msgid ""
"The purpose of this page is to document all the ROS 2 interfaces "
"available in ArduPilot. Content is organized by functional area the data "
"is used."
msgstr "本页旨在记录 ArduPilot 中所有可用的 ROS 2 接口，内容按数据使用的功能领域进行组织。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:11 fcb74415e4794317a1cddac1c9c0dd77
msgid "Sensors"
msgstr "传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:13 cf9e23fc94dd42faa66ce32cc283eed1
msgid ""
"ArduPilot exposes \"sensor\" type data over DDS, that usually corresponds"
" to a physical component, or some filtered version of it."
msgstr "ArduPilot 通过 DDS 公开「传感器」类型的数据，这些数据通常对应于物理组件或其经过滤波处理后的版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:51 7c811e6c60d541ab804d6e1808faed29
