#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:117 06637dc22d14411eb3862e857cf3aab6
msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:119 5b4fe918679e40f1add35804feb51a17
msgid ""
"The control interfaces are how a companion computer can command the "
"autopilot to move either it's control surfaces, motors, or tell the "
"autopilot to control to a setpoint position, velocity, acceleration. "
"Control includes the high level navigation objectives."
msgstr "控制接口是伴飞计算机向飞控发出指令的方式，可控制舵面、电机，或要求飞控跟踪目标位置、速度、加速度。控制还包含高层导航目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:155 1bf8f1a76e87475e98aaf0566f047c30
msgid ""
"For more information on the high level goal interface, see the "
":ref:`Waypoint Goal Interface<ros2-waypoint-goal-interface>`"
msgstr "关于高层目标接口的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`航点目标接口<ros2-waypoint-goal-interface>`"

