#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:225 892f0404491e4c3c8e492ea68862b414
msgid "Odometry"
msgstr "里程计"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:227 5e2370087f0c4d7ab7ec024f9e05e3b0
msgid ""
"Ardupilot may not have a good estimate of where it is relative to where "
"it started moving. A companion computer can interface with sensors that "
"provide odometry, which is the computation of the dynamic transform from "
"the ``odom`` frame to the ``base_link`` frame. This data is fed into "
"ArduPilot's ``AP_VisualOdom`` library. This data may come from visual "
"sensors, however other technologies such as radar and lidar can also "
"provide odometry data. Regardless of the method of odometry, ArduPilot "
"has a single ROS interface to receive it."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 可能无法准确估计其相对于起始位置的当前位置。伴飞计算机可与提供里程计数据的传感器交互，里程计是从 ``odom`` 坐标系到 "
"``base_link`` 坐标系的动态变换计算。这些数据会输入到 ArduPilot 的 ``AP_VisualOdom`` "
"库中。数据可来自视觉传感器，也可来自雷达、激光雷达等其他技术。无论使用哪种里程计方法，ArduPilot 均通过统一的 ROS 接口接收数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:234 b459154e7be1488fbf5579e8e03b1d29
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This data typically comes from a `TF2 Transform Tree "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Intermediate/Tf2/Tf2-Main.html>`_."
" For more information on the coordinate systems used, review `ROS REP-105"
" <https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-0105.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"这些数据通常来自 `TF2 变换树 "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Intermediate/Tf2/Tf2-Main.html>`_。关于所用坐标系的更多信息，请参阅"
" `ROS REP-105 <https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-0105.html>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:256 5c98ad82fa0d448687374fbc8b7297c6
msgid ""
"Only the dynamic transformations on ``/ap/tf`` that have parent_frame "
"``odom`` and child_frame ``base_link`` are fed into ``AP_VisualOdom``. "
"Other frame configurations will be gracefully ignored, so feel free to "
"populate this topic with other transforms if that's convenient."
msgstr ""
"只有 ``/ap/tf`` 上父坐标系为 ``odom``、子坐标系为 ``base_link`` 的动态变换才会输入到 "
"``AP_VisualOdom``。其他坐标系配置将被忽略，可以根据需要在此话题中发布其他变换。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:259 cbf5be72ae7b495b97cd86c0964b9cd1
msgid ""
"For more information on how to setup ArduPilot with an external odometry "
"source, see the :ref:`cartographer SLAM example<ros2-cartographer-slam>`."
msgstr ""
"关于如何将 ArduPilot 配置为使用外部里程计数据源，请参阅 :ref:`Cartographer SLAM 示例<ros2"
"-cartographer-slam>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:262 769f8ea507604ac78bb70e7aa8ce473a
msgid "Configuring Interfaces at Compile Time"
msgstr "编译时配置接口"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:264 a2dc8684b2864fb6a5772aabda72e8c6
msgid ""
"ArduPilot strives to only consume the resources it needs. The DDS "
"interface is no exception."
msgstr "ArduPilot 致力于只使用必要的资源，DDS 接口也不例外。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:267 cdf0bfb4c6444690be8cdd00a1f52f5c
msgid ""
"Every topic and service can be individually enabled or disabled at "
"compile time. See :ref:`common-oem-customizations`."
msgstr "每个话题和服务均可在编译时单独启用或禁用。请参阅 :ref:`common-oem-customizations`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:271 4f32a2f8cf534dd78fc6e01264a2dbf8
msgid ""
"Refer to the `AP_DDS_Config.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_DDS/AP_DDS_config.h>`_"
" file on what is exposed."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 `AP_DDS_Config.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_DDS/AP_DDS_config.h>`_"
" 文件了解所公开的接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:274 044a2cd93c6849f78fe7df65d4cd949b
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Additionally, publish rates form ArduPilot also all individually "
"configurable at compile time."
msgstr "此外，ArduPilot 的发布频率也均可在编译时单独配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:276 2f8f5907d8f047ebaa1433709a6b3637
msgid ""
"When deploying ArduPilot on a resource constrained autopilot, developers "
"can disable interfaces they do not use and tune data rates to only what "
"their applications need."
msgstr "在资源受限的飞控上部署 ArduPilot 时，开发者可以禁用不使用的接口，并将数据速率调整为应用所需的最低限度。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:281 fb5f1aa439074ada923e52865a70ac28
msgid "Adding New Interfaces"
msgstr "添加新接口"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:283 7f7c9627c0184285a1f6fdfcd00aba57
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's DDS interface is designed to be extensible. Interfaces for "
"pub/sub and services are easily added."
msgstr "ArduPilot 的 DDS 接口设计具有可扩展性，发布/订阅接口和服务接口均可方便地添加。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:286 f2dda9593316457cb6b642dc898caee6
msgid ""
"If the interfaces are generic, consider contributing them to ArduPilot. "
"Custom application-specific interfaces are also easy to add and maintain "
"on private forks of ArduPilot."
msgstr "如果接口具有通用性，请考虑将其贡献给 ArduPilot。特定应用的自定义接口也可以在 ArduPilot 的私有 fork 中方便地添加和维护。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:290 9b188a5ce4654068bdc4f3616f2ca4e4
msgid ""
"Interfaces that use custom messages that aren't already used commonly in "
"the ROS 2 ecosystem are typically added with an ``experimental`` "
"designator."
msgstr "使用 ROS 2 生态系统中尚未普遍应用的自定义消息的接口，通常会带有 ``experimental`` （实验性）标识。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:295 f8ab0de35a5a462dad425e11a109e1d6
msgid "ABI Stability Guarantees"
msgstr "ABI 稳定性保证"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:297 664ec53cd5584244a3bfb33d3c7bb38b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's DDS interface is intended to be ABI stable within an "
"ArduPilot minor release. Common interfaces such as ``NavSatFix`` are "
"unlikely to change, however experimental interfaces such as ``IMU`` may "
"change, and are denoted with the ``experimental`` topic prefix. In "
"extenuating circumstances, non-experimental topics may require bugfixes "
"that change behavior, however message definitions will be kept "
"compatible."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的 DDS 接口在同一次要版本内保证 ABI 稳定。``NavSatFix`` 等通用接口不大可能改变，但 ``IMU`` "
"等实验性接口可能会变化，以 ``experimental`` 话题前缀标识。在特殊情况下，非实验性话题可能需要修复 bug "
"而改变行为，但消息定义将保持兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:303 677523e952994aa9bf25768d38bc3499
msgid ""
"Because the ROS way of updating messages is to not change messages within"
" a ROS release, many tools do not cope well with messages. Different "
"versions of the message between an autopilot and companion computer can "
"lead to receiving junk data without any errors, or cryptic serialization "
"errors. Thus, ArduPilot will do it's best to avoid changing messages. If "
"breaking changes are required, the ArduPilot release notes will make that"
" clear."
msgstr ""
"由于 ROS "
"的惯例是在同一版本内不修改消息，许多工具对消息不兼容处理较差。飞控与伴飞计算机之间消息版本不一致可能导致无任何报错地收到垃圾数据，或出现难以理解的序列化错误。因此，ArduPilot"
" 将尽量避免修改消息。若必须进行不兼容修改，ArduPilot 的发行说明将明确指出。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:310 84eac403a35b4e3a985279e724261dd4
#, fuzzy
msgid "Developers should not expect ABI stability on ``experimental`` interfaces."
msgstr "开发者不应期望 ``exerimental`` （实验性）接口具有 ABI 稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:312 c3eb93dc4df74de4b55038a2f3c9663f
msgid ""
"Because ArduPilot does not follow the same release timeline as ROS 2, and"
" the development team for the ROS interface is still in its early stages,"
" ArduPilot does not yet support a stable ABI across multiple ROS "
"distributions. The current ROS version supported is ``humble``."
msgstr ""
"由于 ArduPilot 的发布时间表与 ROS 2 不一致，且 ROS 接口开发团队仍处于早期阶段，ArduPilot 目前尚不支持跨多个 "
"ROS 发行版的稳定 ABI。当前支持的 ROS 版本为 ``humble``。"

